@startuml
title Sequence - UC-16 Xác thực người dùng (OAuth2/OIDC)
actor "User (Student/Admin/Driver)" as User
participant "Client App/Web" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "IdP (Google/Azure)" as IdP

User -> Client : Click "Đăng nhập với tài khoản nhà trường"
Client -> API : /auth/login (redirect)
API -> Auth : start oauth2 flow
Auth -> IdP : Authorization Request
IdP --> User : Login form
User -> IdP : credentials
IdP --> Auth : Authorization Code
Auth -> IdP : Token Exchange
IdP --> Auth : id_token, access_token
Auth --> API : session / jwt
API --> Client : set session, redirect back
Client --> User : Logged in
@enduml